  "prefLabel": "Puc 902.12 End-User Customer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 902.12 “End-User Customer” means any person or entity that purchases electricity supply at retail in New Hampshire from another person or entity, with the exception of a generating facility taking station service at wholesale from the regional markets administered by ISO New England, Inc. or its successor independent system operator or regional market administrator.\n\nSource. #13080, eff 9-14-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc900.html"
}
